  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_maser_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>mazer, a drinking cup (Cobb 182; OED s.v. mazer n.) | mazer wood (properly maple) or other hardwood (Cobb 182; OED s.v. mazer n.) | a bowl, drinking-cup or goblet, made with mazer wood (properly maple), often richly carved or ornamented and mounted with silver and gold or other metal (OED s.v. mazer n.) | clogs made of hardwood | a drinking cup made of mazer wood (properly maple) or other hardwood (Cobb 182; OED s.v. mazer n.) | mazer, a drinking cup, made of wood (Cobb 182)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
